# The breath gate: a phrase with no breath behind it is silent (a controller's stray notes at its
# threshold, breath CC near 0); a sliver of breath opens it, and above that the level is the breath's no more
wait 200
# no breath heard yet (a controller without it, or on another CC): notes play, as before
midi 90 3D 40
wait 200
expect amp 100
midi 80 3D 00
wait 300
# the breath heard once: a note with no breath is silent
breath 0 60 50
breath 60 0 50
wait 300
midi 90 3D 40
wait 200
expect gate 1
expect amp 0
peakreset
wait 100
expect peak_db_max -70
# breath CC 3: still closed to a whisper
midi B0 02 03
wait 100
peakreset
wait 100
expect peak_db_max -50
# CC 11 (over 8 %): open
midi B0 02 0B
wait 100
expect amp 100
# more breath: the level stays (breath opens the filter, not the amp)
midi B0 02 7F
wait 100
expect amp 100
# tapering off with the note held: the level the phrase reached holds
midi B0 02 00
wait 100
expect amp 100
midi 80 3D 00
wait 300
# a stray note from silence again: closed
midi 90 3D 40
midi B0 02 01
wait 100
expect amp <2
midi 80 3D 00
wait 300
# the release rings: breath and note off together, Release 360 ms, the level 40 ms on is the release's
tap ENV
wait 50
spin K3 300
wait 300
midi 90 3D 40
breath 0 100 30
wait 300
breath 100 0 20
midi 80 3D 00
wait 40
peakreset
wait 20
expect peak_db_min -42
# the curve doesn't move it: at Curve -100 (x^4), CC 40 is open
spin K1 -200
wait 300
expect par5 -100
midi 90 3D 40
midi B0 02 28
wait 100
expect amp 100
midi 80 3D 00
wait 300
# a panel key plays at full breath: never closed
key 4 down
wait 50
expect amp 100
expect level >5
key 4 up
wait 50
expect stale 0
